# An allow-list: the build context is the repo root, so everything is excluded unless a
# Dockerfile needs it. A new config or secret file therefore cannot reach an image by accident.
# When the server gains a path dependency, add it here as well as to its pyproject.toml.
*

!apps/server/
!packages/proto/utils/
!packages/organization-info/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed paths: host-built or host-specific state.
**/.venv
**/gen
# Except the server's generated code, which the image uses as built on the host.
!apps/server/api/gen/
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.private.*
**/*.local.*
**/private
**/.env
**/.env.*
